            {
              "text": "Dal Baati tastes best when eaten with pickles and yogurt (lassi)! >R",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "There are regional variations - Jodhpuri Dal Baati tastes different from Udaipuri! <�",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
