          "didYouKnow": {
            "text": "Dal Baati is SO popular that there's a tongue twister in Hindi: 'Dal Baati, Churma, Ker Sangri' - it's the traditional Rajasthani meal combo! Even kids chant it like a rhyme! <�",
            "minAge": 3,
            "maxAge": 99
          },
