        "en": {
          "title": "<� THAR DESERT - India's Giant Sandbox!",
          "emoji": "<�",
          "mainText": "The Thar is a vast desert region with hot summers, cool winter nights and many communities adapted to desert life. It extends across northwestern India and into Pakistan. <�",
