          "title": "<� GOLCONDA FORT - The Diamond Fortress!",
          "emoji": "<�",
          "mainText": "A massive hilltop fort where FAMOUS DIAMONDS like the Kohinoor were once stored and traded!",
          "keyFacts": [
            {
              "text": "Built over 200 years by the Qutb Shahi dynasty! <�",
              "minAge": 3,
