            "minAge": 6,
            "maxAge": 99
          },
          {
            "text": "Grow stronger with age, unlike wooden bridges that rot! =�",
            "minAge": 3,
            "maxAge": 99
          },
          {
            "text": "Cherrapunji/Mawsynram nearby are among the wettest places on Earth! <'",
            "minAge": 3,
            "maxAge": 99
          },
          {
            "text": "A UNESCO Tentative World Heritage candidate! <�",
            "minAge": 8,
