          {
            "text": "Reaching some bridges takes a multi-hour trek through jungle! >~",
            "minAge": 3,
            "maxAge": 99
          },
          {
            "text": "Mawlynnong village nearby is called the 'cleanest village in Asia'! >�",
            "minAge": 3,
            "maxAge": 99
          }
        ],
        "coolFacts": [
          {
            "text": "Living root bridges get STRONGER over time instead of weaker! =�",
            "minAge": 3,
            "maxAge": 99
          },
          {
            "text": "It can take a whole generation - 15 to 30 years - to grow just one bridge! �",
            "minAge": 3,
            "maxAge": 99
          },
          {
            "text": "The Double Decker Root Bridge has two separate crossing levels! <	",
            "minAge": 3,
