          "title": "=� BIHAR - Cradle of Ancient Wisdom!",
          "emoji": "=�",
          "mainText": "Home to the one of the oldest known university, the place an important place in the history of Buddhism, and the birthplace of great empires - Bihar shaped the story of ancient India!",
