            {
              "text": "Madhubani painting, a folk art style, comes from Bihar! <�",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "One of India's most historically significant states! =�",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
