              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Gundruk: fermented leafy green vegetable dish! >l",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Chhurpi: a hard, chewy cheese made from yak or cow milk! >�",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Millet and buckwheat are grown in the hills! <>",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Sikkim is India's first fully organic farming state! <1",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Tongba: warm fermented millet drink, sipped through a bamboo straw! >d",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Simple, warming food suited to mountain life! D",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Recipes shared with neighboring Nepal, Tibet, and Bhutan! <�",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            }
          ],
          "coolFacts": [
            {
              "text": "Sikkim became India's first 100% organic farming state in 2016 - no chemical fertilizers or pesticides allowed! <1",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Tongba is served in a hollowed-out bamboo or wooden pot, sipped through a special bamboo straw! >d",
