        "en": {
          "title": "<� ANDAMAN & NICOBAR - India's Remote Island Paradise!",
          "emoji": "<�",
          "mainText": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands are a group of islands in the Bay of Bengal. They include Barren Island, home to Indias only confirmed active volcano. <",
          "keyFacts": [
            {
              "text": "Made up of over 500 islands, only about 37 inhabited! <�",
              "minAge": 3,
