            {
              "text": "Home to the Sentinelese - possibly the most isolated tribe on Earth! <�",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Cellular Jail: powerful memorial to India's freedom fighters! =",
              "minAge": 3,
