              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Rich coral reefs make it a top diving destination! = ",
              "minAge": 3,
              "maxAge": 99
            },
            {
              "text": "Radhanagar Beach: ranked among Asia's best! <�",
              "minAge": 3,
